    <id>https://www.strangerfoods.org/recipes/claypot-chicken-rice</id>
    <title>Claypot chicken rice</title>
    <updated>2026-06-07T16:25:27.406291+00:00</updated>
    <content type="html">&lt;h1 style="text-align:center;font-family:sans-serif;"&gt;Claypot chicken rice&lt;/h1&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;img src="https://www.strangerfoods.org/images/claypot-chicken-rice.webp" style="text-align:center;"/&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;p style="font-family:sans-serif;&gt;If you can, cook this dish the traditional way in a claypot. You will get to enjoy a particularly crunchy layer of rice, which will form at the base and is an important characteristic of the dish. The combination of fluffy and crunchy rice, chicken generously coated in a tasty sauce and the earthy flavour of Chinese mushrooms makes this a mouth-watering and satisfying dish.&lt;/p&gt;</content>
